  "help_blchat": "<blockquote><b>{e_ban} ʙʟᴀᴄᴋʟɪꜱᴛ ᴄʜᴀᴛ</b></blockquote>\n\n{e_bullet} /blacklistchat [id]\n{e_bullet} /whitelistchat [id]\n{e_bullet} /blacklistedchat",
  "help_bluser": "<blockquote><b>{e_ban} ʙʟᴀᴄᴋʟɪꜱᴛ ᴜꜱᴇʀ</b></blockquote>\n\n{e_bullet} /block [id]\n{e_bullet} /unblock [id]\n{e_bullet} /blockedusers",
  "help_gban": "<blockquote><b>⛔ ɢ-ʙᴀɴ</b></blockquote>\n\n{e_bullet} /gban [id] [reason]\n{e_bullet} /ungban [id]\n{e_bullet} /gbanlist",
  "help_loop": "<blockquote><b>{e_loop} ʟᴏᴏᴘ ᴍᴏᴅᴇ</b></blockquote>\n\n{e_bullet} /loop — ꜱʜᴏᴡ ᴄᴜʀʀᴇɴᴛ ᴍᴏᴅᴇ\n{e_bullet} /loop disable\n{e_bullet} /loop single\n{e_bullet} /loop queue",
  "help_seek": "<blockquote><b>{e_seek} ꜱᴇᴇᴋ</b></blockquote>\n\n{e_bullet} /seek [ꜱᴇᴄꜱ / ᴍᴍ:ꜱꜱ]\n{e_bullet} /seekback [ᴅᴜʀ]\n{e_bullet} /seekforward [ᴅᴜʀ]\n\n<b>ᴇx:</b> <code>/seek 1:30</code>",
